  "title": "Ham and Shrimp Gravy",
  "description": "Chef John's ham and shrimp gravy recipe with diced ham, shrimp, bell pepper, celery, green onion, jalapeños, and garlic is perfect over potatoes or rice.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
